# Pairs with ParentSiblingConsistency. The parent route appears before reverse links are repaired.
MODULE: ChainDonorPublishesEarly
TARGET: ParentSiblingConsistency
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: parent routing exposes a sibling before the chain is consistent
PERTURBS: ChainDonor

--- FIND
ChainDonor ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ ~donorNext
    /\ donorNext' = TRUE
    /\ linked' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: publish the route before the successor back-link.
ChainDonor ==
    /\ phase = "splitting"
    /\ born
    /\ ~donorNext
    /\ donorNext' = TRUE
    /\ linked' = TRUE
--- END
